# HA Dashboard — Design Standards & Safety Rules

## Safety Rules (Never Break)

- **Never add `unique_id` to dashboard YAML** — `unique_id` belongs only in `configuration.yaml` config entries (e.g. `command_line` sensors). It has no effect in Lovelace cards and creates confusion.
- **Always use 2-space indentation** throughout all YAML files.
- **Always add `fill_container: true`** to every card inside a `horizontal-stack`.
- **Never use `mushroom-entity-card` with `toggle: true` for fans or switches that would open a dialog** — see the Direct Toggle pattern below.

---

## Tech Stack

- Home Assistant (container / HA OS) — YAML dashboard at `ui-ipad-dashboard.yaml`
- Theme: **Frosted Glass Dark** (`themes/Frosted Glass/Frosted Glass Dark.yaml`) — glass morphism, `blur(10px)`, dark tints
- HACS frontend cards in use:
  - `custom:mushroom-*` (lovelace-mushroom v5+) — primary card family
  - `custom:layout-card` + `custom:grid-layout` — page structure
  - `lovelace-card-mod` — CSS overrides via `card_mod.style`
  - `browser_mod` v2+ — `browser_mod.popup` via `fire-dom-event`
  - `custom:clock-weather-card` — sidebar clock

---

## Page Structure

Every view uses a full-panel grid-layout with a fixed sidebar:

```yaml
- type: custom:layout-card
  layout_type: custom:grid-layout
  layout:
    grid-template-columns: "280px minmax(0, 1fr)"
    grid-template-areas: |
      "sidebar main"
    grid-gap: "10px"
    padding: "10px"
```

Subviews (room tabs) use `subview: true` + single-column full-width:

```yaml
- title: Office
  path: office
  subview: true
  theme: "Frosted Glass Dark"
  panel: true
```

Navigation between views: `tap_action: action: navigate` to `/ui-ipad/{path}`. Back buttons navigate to `/ui-ipad/home`.

---

## Section Headers

All section headers use `mushroom-title-card` with an 8 px top margin:

```yaml
- type: custom:mushroom-title-card
  title: Living Room
  card_mod:
    style: |
      ha-card { margin-top: 8px !important; }
```

Use `margin-top: 4px` (not 8px) for the first item after the clock/weather card.

---

## Color Palette (icon_color values)

| State / Context | Color |
|---|---|
| Active / on | entity-appropriate (cyan=fan, deep-orange=heater/boiler, amber=good morning, indigo=night/good night, green=welcome/safe, orange=away/exit, purple=movie, blue=blinds/office) |
| Inactive / off | `grey` |
| Warning | `amber` or `orange` |
| Alert | `red` |
| AC on | `orange` |

