## Golden Example 2 — Direct Toggle (Fan / Switch / Heater)

Never use `mushroom-entity-card` with `toggle: true` for fans or heaters — it opens a dialog on tap. Use `mushroom-template-card` with an explicit service call instead:

```yaml
# Fan: direct toggle via service call — no dialog
- type: custom:mushroom-template-card
  primary: >
    {{ 'Fan On' if is_state('fan.slvn_slvn_tqrh', 'on') else 'Fan Off' }}
  secondary: Living Room
  icon: >
    {{ 'mdi:fan' if is_state('fan.slvn_slvn_tqrh', 'on') else 'mdi:fan-off' }}
  icon_color: >
    {{ 'cyan' if is_state('fan.slvn_slvn_tqrh', 'on') else 'grey' }}
  layout: vertical
  fill_container: true
  tap_action:
    action: call-service
    service: fan.toggle          # or switch.toggle for heaters
    target:
      entity_id: fan.slvn_slvn_tqrh
```

Apply the same pattern (with `switch.toggle`) for bathroom heaters and the boiler switch.

