## card_mod CSS Patterns

Alert/warning banner styling:
```yaml
card_mod:
  style: |
    ha-card {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,180,0,0.6) !important;
      background: rgba(255,180,0,0.12) !important;
      margin-bottom: 6px !important;
    }
```

Max-width constraint (e.g. back button):
```yaml
card_mod:
  style: |
    ha-card { max-width: 120px; }
```

---

## Climate Cards

All `mushroom-climate-card` instances must list `hvac_modes` explicitly, including `heat_cool` if the entity supports it:

```yaml
- type: custom:mushroom-climate-card
  entity: climate.l8_105
  name: Bedroom
  hvac_modes:
    - "off"
    - cool
    - heat
    - heat_cool
    - fan_only
    - dry
  show_temperature_control: true
  fill_container: true
```
